### 总览：详情 / 摘要 / 不落库的局部更新预览
GET http://localhost:8030/api/mapstruct/overview

### 样例详情（主键是字符串，金额是元）
GET http://localhost:8030/api/mapstruct/orders/sample

### 摘要列表
GET http://localhost:8030/api/mapstruct/orders/summaries

### 创建：客户端 id 会被忽略；19.90×2 + 1.00 = 40.80
POST http://localhost:8030/api/mapstruct/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "buyerName": "李四",
  "statusCode": 10,
  "remark": "加急",
  "address": {"province": "浙江省", "city": "宁波市", "street": "天一广场"},
  "items": [
    {"skuCode": "SKU-1", "skuName": "杯子", "quantity": 2, "priceYuan": 19.90},
    {"skuCode": "SKU-2", "skuName": "盖子", "quantity": 1, "priceYuan": 1.00}
  ]
}

### 不传明细：items 为 []，金额 0
POST http://localhost:8030/api/mapstruct/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "buyerName": "无明细",
  "statusCode": 10
}

### 未知状态码（body.code=400）
POST http://localhost:8030/api/mapstruct/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "buyerName": "状态",
  "statusCode": 99
}

### 金额超过两位小数（body.code=400）
POST http://localhost:8030/api/mapstruct/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "buyerName": "小数",
  "statusCode": 10,
  "items": [{"skuCode": "A", "skuName": "a", "quantity": 1, "priceYuan": 1.999}]
}

### 局部更新：把上一笔创建返回的 id 填到路径里。没传的字段保持原值
PATCH http://localhost:8030/api/mapstruct/orders/9007199254741001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "remark": "已改",
  "statusCode": 20
}

### 地址只改街道
PATCH http://localhost:8030/api/mapstruct/orders/9007199254741001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": {"street": "西湖"}
}

### 明细整表替换，金额按新明细重算
PATCH http://localhost:8030/api/mapstruct/orders/9007199254741001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [{"skuCode": "SKU-9", "skuName": "壶", "quantity": 3, "priceYuan": 3.00}]
}

### 订单不存在（body.code=404）
PATCH http://localhost:8030/api/mapstruct/orders/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "remark": "不存在"
}
